{"overview":"پدیده‌ای به نام «ادغام» باعث شده است که بسیاری از سرزمین‌های افسانه‌ای ناگهان در یک جهان ترکیب شوند، اما این اتحاد ناپایدار است. یک استاد نینجای اسپینجیتزو باید نسل جدیدی از قهرمانان را آموزش دهد تا اژدهای عنصری را پیدا کنند و قبل از اینکه نیروهای شر از همان انرژی اژدها برای نابودی این دنیای جدید استفاده کنند، سیاره را نجات دهند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"A phenomenon known as the Merge has caused many legendary realms to suddenly combine into one, but their union is unstable. A Spinjitzu Ninja Master must train a new generation of heroes to help find Elemental Dragons who can save the planet before the forces of evil use the same dragon energy to destroy this new world.","tagline_en":"A new generation of heroes are rising!","runtime":22,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":4,"y":2024,"poster":"/apXjzEhUR3LqK4g4Lypab91yq7Y.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":20,"y":2023,"poster":"/khFEp3DnF8i2YhGRI9tDheuyvjL.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":20,"y":2024,"poster":"/pe2gdBRkD84158lHR6bVwVS15BT.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":20,"y":2025,"poster":"/nKhuOU34hG4jlxFUJwSxXNgP9jv.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":20,"y":2026,"poster":"/ow71ZtJ9PNX74DvVdJWVC599PRb.jpg"}],"episodes":80,"crew":["کریس ویات","Kevin Burke"],"crew_en":["Chris Wyatt","Kevin Burke"],"countries":["CA","US"],"cast":[],"trailer":"nTxmOgv11Ck","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/212989-lego-ninjago-dragons-rising/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1KljqmbvO9HQa1PBFLILWah72.png"},{"n":"Amazon Prime Video","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/gMZdpavHmxFNnLpMHwVxfqeux2g.png"},{"n":"Peacock Premium","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/a1UIdq5BrkcAxnxcUhFsNbXnxeu.png"},{"n":"Netflix Standard with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/eGUwOOIxcazwEBxqJpSN5sWEu6V.png"},{"n":"Amazon Prime Video with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/tpwTT1FpWqLLhxUfAuDavIXDDfI.png"},{"n":"Peacock Premium Plus","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/yrEwyMzEKdqAoGhaWUARtIxByo